### Change #4: Root layout
**File:** `services/frontend/app/layout.tsx`
**Action:** Write (new file). The App Router refuses to build without a root
layout that renders `<html>`/`<body>`. It must contain **no `<h1>`** — the test
locator `page.locator('h1')` must resolve to exactly one element.
**Content:**
```tsx
import type { ReactNode } from 'react';

export const metadata = {
  title: 'Frontend',
};

export default function RootLayout({ children }: { children: ReactNode }) {
  return (
    <html lang="en">
      <body>{children}</body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

